<header><p class="enc-kicker"><a href="/encyclopedia/conflicts/15th-century">Conflicts &amp; Resolutions</a> · Battle</p><h1 class="enc-title">Battle of Otlukbeli</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">1473</span> · <a href="/centuries/15th-century">15th century</a> · Also known as Battle of Başkent</p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Battle of Otlukbeli was fought on 11 August 1473 near <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/erzincan">Erzincan</a> in eastern <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/anatolia">Anatolia</a> between the Ottoman sultan <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/mehmed-ii">Mehmed II</a> and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/uzun-hasan">Uzun Hasan</a> of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/aq-qoyunlu">Aq Qoyunlu</a>. Ottoman artillery and firearms decided the day, ending Uzun Hasan's challenge to the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ottoman-empire">Ottomans</a> in Anatolia and his hopes of an effective alliance with <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/venice">Venice</a>.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/battle-of-otlukbeli.jpg" alt="Battle of Otlukbeli" width="320" height="383" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Unknown authorUnknown author · Public domain · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Otlukbeli_savasi.png" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
